  "description": "This is a complete build package available for a limited time.\nThe Apogee One is an innovative 140mm trail bike that features our precision-machined Free Float Module suspension and handmade steel DuoFrame. It’s a modern classic that pairs advanced suspension kinematics with a frame that’s specifically tuned for a smooth and playful ride.\nEach frame is hand-welded, machined, and built exclusively in the Pacific Northwest, USA. See more about how it's made. Production typically takes about 4 months.\nTo order a frameset only, or for custom build options, please see our configurator for more options.\nPhotos may show custom options. All colors come with a Gunmetal Gray Free Float Module. Contact us at admin@apogee.bike for bespoke build options and pricing.",
